fsot-pc-monitor
Copyright 2026 Damian Arthur Palumbo

This product is the FSOT host-plant PC monitor (fold plant_host_v1):
low-overhead hardware telemetry plus scalar/trit science. The instrument
fold is pinned at D1D38A (seeds match fsot-neuron-zig) as documented in
README.md and BRIDGE.md.

This repository is part of the FSOT (Fluid Spacetime Omni-Theory) family.
Theory authority is vendor/fsot_compute.py in
https://github.com/dappalumbo91/FSOT-2.1-Lean (pin AEB2AD), also by
Damian Arthur Palumbo and licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Rust crate dependencies (not bundled, fetched by Cargo; see Cargo.toml):
sysinfo (MIT), chrono, serde, serde_json, eframe, egui, egui_plot and
sha2 (each MIT OR Apache-2.0).
